      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3557,
      "text": "[It all happened] so that Allah may reward the truthful for their truthfulness, and punish the hypocrites if He wills, or accept their repentance. Indeed, Allah is All-Forgiving, Most Merciful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 33,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَحۡزَابِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ahzaab",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 73,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 421,
      "ruku": 363,
      "hizbQuarter": 168,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3558,
      "text": "Allah has repelled the disbelievers in their rage without gaining any good. And Allah spared the believers from fighting, and Allah is All-Powerful, All-Mighty.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 33,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَحۡزَابِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ahzaab",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 73,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 421,
      "ruku": 363,
      "hizbQuarter": 168,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3559,
      "text": "And He brought down those of the People of the Book[25] who supported them from their fortresses, and cast horror into their hearts: you killed some and took others as captives.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 33,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَحۡزَابِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ahzaab",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 73,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 421,
      "ruku": 363,
      "hizbQuarter": 168,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3560,
      "text": "He also made you inherit their land, their homes and their wealth, and a land on which you have not yet set foot[26]. And Allah is Most Capable of all things.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 33,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَحۡزَابِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ahzaab",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 73,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 421,
      "ruku": 363,
      "hizbQuarter": 168,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3561,
      "text": "O Prophet, tell your wives, “If you seek the life of this world and its embellishments, then come, I will give you provision and release you graciously.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 33,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَحۡزَابِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ahzaab",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 73,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 21,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 421,
      "ruku": 364,
      "hizbQuarter": 168,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3562,
      "text": "But if you seek Allah and His Messenger and the Final Abode, then Allah has prepared for those who do good among you a great reward.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 33,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَحۡزَابِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ahzaab",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clans",
        "numberOfAyahs": 73,
